# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# OS
.DS_Store

# Datasets -- large raw image data, not source code.
# data/fer-2013/ is the public Kaggle FER-2013 dataset (re-downloadable).
# data/gesture/ is this project's own webcam-collected gesture data (gdg/,
# noise/); not tracked here due to size (~672M), but it isn't reproducible
# from a public source the way data/fer-2013/ is -- keep it backed up separately.
data/fer-2013/
data/gesture/

# Generated features/checkpoints -- rebuild via pipeline/preprocess.py and
# pipeline/train.py (see README's "Retraining the hand-gesture model").
# Exceptions: gesture_model.pt (the actual trained gesture MLP) and
# label_map.json (tiny, and required at *inference* runtime, not just
# training -- see GestureEmotionPipeline.__init__) are shipped in the repo so
# GitHub access alone is enough to run inference, minus the separately-sent
# Hugging Face model cache. Everything else here stays generated-only:
# checkpoints/emotion_model.pt is an unused from-scratch baseline (the live
# pipeline uses the pretrained ViT instead), and features/*.npz are large
# training-only feature arrays.
features/*
!features/label_map.json
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/gesture_model.pt

# Local demo output -- contains real captured photos from test sessions.
demo/output/
output/
